    ['marsh-crocodiles-and-wetland-at-jawai-dam', 'Marsh Crocodiles and Wetland Life at the Jawai Dam', 'Wildlife', 'jawai-bandh',
     'Beyond leopards, the Jawai reservoir supports crocodiles, fish and thousands of birds.',
     'Marsh Crocodiles and Wetland Wildlife at Jawai Dam',
     'Learn about the marsh crocodiles and wetland wildlife at Jawai Dam: where to look, safety, birds and how to watch responsibly.',
     'Jawai Dam crocodile, marsh crocodile Jawai, Jawai Bandh wildlife, Jawai wetland birds, crocodile Jawai Rajasthan',
     'Jawai Dam is often described as one of the larger reservoirs in western Rajasthan. Around it you may find far more than leopards.',
     [['Crocodiles', 'Marsh crocodiles, also called muggers, are known to live around the reservoir. They bask on sandbars and rocks on warm days. They are best watched from a distance with binoculars.'],
