      ['Can I swim in the dam?', 'No. It is unsafe and not allowed in many places.']], 'safari'],

    ['rajasthani-folk-music-and-dance-guide', 'Rajasthani Folk Music and Dance: Ghoomar, Kalbeliya and Desert Songs', 'Culture', 'jawai-village-celebration',
