      ['Can I record performers?', 'Ask first, and tip if you take photos or videos.']], 'culture'],

    ['rajasthani-turban-safa-and-rabari-dress-explained', 'Rajasthani Turbans and Rabari Dress: What the Red Pagri Means', 'Culture', 'jawai-rabari-man',
     'The turban is more than a hat. A short guide to colours, styles and the dress of Jawai’s herders.',
