     [['Classics', '- Ghevar: a honeycomb-like disc fried in ghee and soaked in syrup, popular in the monsoon and festivals. || - Malpua with rabdi: soft pancakes with thickened sweet milk. || - Churma ladoo: sweet crumbled baati rolled into balls.'],
