     [['Savoury favourites', '- Pyaaz kachori: crisp pastry filled with spiced onion. || - Mirchi vada: a chilli stuffed with spiced potato and fried in batter. || - Poha: flattened rice with peanuts, a lighter option. || - Dahi vada and samosa are also common.'],
